{"seq":4,"slug":"error-handling","title":"错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations/error-handling","wordCount":895,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"错误处理\">错误处理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>错误处理</strong>（Error Handling）在 CLI 中要同时面对两个受众：<strong>人类用户</strong>需要看懂&quot;发生了什么、为什么、怎么修&quot;，<strong>脚本与自动化</strong>需要机器可读的成功/失败信号。二者由不同的通道承载。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>受众</th>\n<th>关心什么</th>\n<th>承载方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人类用户</td>\n<td>原因与修复建议</td>\n<td>stderr 上的友好消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脚本/自动化</td>\n<td>成功还是失败、哪类失败</td>\n<td>退出码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发者</td>\n<td>错误发生的完整链路</td>\n<td>错误链（context/source）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>据此可以推出两条基本策略：<strong>在 <code>main</code> 统一兜底</strong>（把错误格式化后写到 stderr 并给出退出码），以及<strong>优先 graceful 而非 panic</strong>（panic 只用于真正的 bug）。本文依次展开消息写法、退出码约定、anyhow/thiserror 分工与分层输出。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理的两面\">错误处理的两面</h2><p>CLI 工具的<strong>错误处理</strong>（Error Handling）面向两个受众：使用工具的人类用户，以及调用工具的脚本和自动化流程。好的错误处理在两个层面都提供清晰的信息。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>受众</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>传达方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人类用户</td>\n<td>发生了什么，如何修复</td>\n<td>stderr 中的友好消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脚本/自动化</td>\n<td>成功还是失败，什么类型的失败</td>\n<td>退出码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[错误发生] --&gt; B{面向谁?}&#10;    B --&gt;|人类| C[友好的错误消息]&#10;    B --&gt;|脚本| D[退出码]&#10;    C --&gt; E[stderr 输出]&#10;    D --&gt; F[process::exit]&#10;    E --&gt; G[用户理解问题并修复]&#10;    F --&gt; H[脚本根据退出码分支]\">graph TD\n    A[错误发生] --&gt; B{面向谁?}\n    B --&gt;|人类| C[友好的错误消息]\n    B --&gt;|脚本| D[退出码]\n    C --&gt; E[stderr 输出]\n    D --&gt; F[process::exit]\n    E --&gt; G[用户理解问题并修复]\n    F --&gt; H[脚本根据退出码分支]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"用户友好的错误消息\">用户友好的错误消息</h2><p>用户友好的错误消息应包含三个要素：<strong>发生了什么</strong>、<strong>为什么发生</strong>、<strong>如何修复</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::path::Path;&#10;&#10;fn validate_config(path: &amp;Path) -&gt; Result&lt;String, String&gt; {&#10;    if !path.exists() {&#10;        return Err(format!(&#10;            &quot;配置文件 &#39;{}&#39; 不存在\\n\\&#10;             提示: 运行 `mytool init` 创建默认配置文件&quot;,&#10;            path.display()&#10;        ));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let content = std::fs::read_to_string(path)&#10;        .map_err(|e| format!(&#10;            &quot;无法读取配置文件 &#39;{}&#39;: {}\\n\\&#10;             提示: 请检查文件权限&quot;,&#10;            path.display(), e&#10;        ))?;&#10;&#10;    if content.trim().is_empty() {&#10;        return Err(format!(&#10;            &quot;配置文件 &#39;{}&#39; 为空\\n\\&#10;             提示: 至少需要包含 [project] 段落&quot;,&#10;            path.display()&#10;        ));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    Ok(content)&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let path = std::path::Path::new(&quot;config.toml&quot;);&#10;    match validate_config(path) {&#10;        Ok(config) =&gt; println!(&quot;配置已加载: {} 字节&quot;, config.len()),&#10;        Err(msg) =&gt; {&#10;            eprintln!(&quot;错误: {}&quot;, msg);&#10;            std::process::exit(1);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::path::Path;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn validate_config(path: &#x26;Path) -> Result&#x3C;String, String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if !path.exists() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Err(format!(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"配置文件 '{}' 不存在\\n\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             提示: 运行 `mytool init` 创建默认配置文件\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            path.display()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let content = std::fs::read_to_string(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map_err(|e| format!(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"无法读取配置文件 '{}': {}\\n\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             提示: 请检查文件权限\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            path.display(), e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if content.trim().is_empty() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Err(format!(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"配置文件 '{}' 为空\\n\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             提示: 至少需要包含 [project] 段落\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            path.display()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let path = std::path::Path::new(\"config.toml\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match validate_config(path) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(config) => println!(\"配置已加载: {} 字节\", config.len()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(msg) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            eprintln!(\"错误: {}\", msg);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            std::process::exit(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误消息要素</th>\n<th>差的示例</th>\n<th>好的示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发生了什么</td>\n<td><code>Error</code></td>\n<td><code>配置文件 &#39;config.toml&#39; 不存在</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>为什么发生</td>\n<td>（无）</td>\n<td><code>未找到指定路径的文件</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>如何修复</td>\n<td>（无）</td>\n<td><code>运行 &#39;mytool init&#39; 创建默认配置</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 始终将错误消息输出到 stderr，而不是 stdout。这样即使在管道中，错误信息也能正确显示给用户。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"退出码约定\">退出码约定</h2><p>定义清晰的<strong>退出码</strong>（Exit Code）约定，让调用方能够程序化地处理不同类型的错误。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[repr(u8)]&#10;enum ExitCode {&#10;    Success = 0,&#10;    GeneralError = 1,&#10;    UsageError = 2,&#10;    ConfigError = 3,&#10;    IoError = 4,&#10;    NetworkError = 5,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl From&lt;ExitCode&gt; for std::process::ExitCode {&#10;    fn from(code: ExitCode) -&gt; Self {&#10;        std::process::ExitCode::from(code as u8)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[derive(Debug)]&#10;enum AppError {&#10;    Usage(String),&#10;    Config(String),&#10;    Io(std::io::Error),&#10;    Network(String),&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl AppError {&#10;    fn exit_code(&amp;self) -&gt; ExitCode {&#10;        match self {&#10;            AppError::Usage(_) =&gt; ExitCode::UsageError,&#10;            AppError::Config(_) =&gt; ExitCode::ConfigError,&#10;            AppError::Io(_) =&gt; ExitCode::IoError,&#10;            AppError::Network(_) =&gt; ExitCode::NetworkError,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn message(&amp;self) -&gt; String {&#10;        match self {&#10;            AppError::Usage(msg) =&gt; format!(&quot;用法错误: {}&quot;, msg),&#10;            AppError::Config(msg) =&gt; format!(&quot;配置错误: {}&quot;, msg),&#10;            AppError::Io(e) =&gt; format!(&quot;IO 错误: {}&quot;, e),&#10;            AppError::Network(msg) =&gt; format!(&quot;网络错误: {}&quot;, msg),&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    if let Err(e) = run() {&#10;        eprintln!(&quot;{}&quot;, e.message());&#10;        std::process::exit(e.exit_code() as i32);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn run() -&gt; Result&lt;(), AppError&gt; {&#10;    let args: Vec&lt;String&gt; = std::env::args().collect();&#10;    if args.len() &lt; 2 {&#10;        return Err(AppError::Usage(&quot;缺少目标文件参数&quot;.into()));&#10;    }&#10;    let content = std::fs::read_to_string(&amp;args[1])&#10;        .map_err(AppError::Io)?;&#10;    println!(&quot;{} 行&quot;, content.lines().count());&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(u8)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum ExitCode {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Success = 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    GeneralError = 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    UsageError = 2,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ConfigError = 3,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IoError = 4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NetworkError = 5,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl From&#x3C;ExitCode> for std::process::ExitCode {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn from(code: ExitCode) -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        std::process::ExitCode::from(code as u8)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Debug)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum AppError {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Usage(String),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Config(String),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Io(std::io::Error),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Network(String),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl AppError {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn exit_code(&#x26;self) -> ExitCode {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        match self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::Usage(_) => ExitCode::UsageError,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::Config(_) => ExitCode::ConfigError,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::Io(_) => ExitCode::IoError,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::Network(_) => ExitCode::NetworkError,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn message(&#x26;self) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        match self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::Usage(msg) => format!(\"用法错误: {}\", msg),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::Config(msg) => format!(\"配置错误: {}\", msg),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::Io(e) => format!(\"IO 错误: {}\", e),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::Network(msg) => format!(\"网络错误: {}\", msg),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if let Err(e) = run() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(\"{}\", e.message());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        std::process::exit(e.exit_code() as i32);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn run() -> Result&#x3C;(), AppError> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let args: Vec&#x3C;String> = std::env::args().collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if args.len() &#x3C; 2 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Err(AppError::Usage(\"缺少目标文件参数\".into()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let content = std::fs::read_to_string(&#x26;args[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map_err(AppError::Io)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{} 行\", content.lines().count());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"anyhow-与-thiserror\">anyhow 与 thiserror</h2><p>Rust 生态中，<strong>anyhow</strong> 和 <strong>thiserror</strong> 是错误处理的两大支柱：anyhow 用于应用级错误（快速包装），thiserror 用于库级错误（精确定义）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use anyhow::{Context, Result, bail};&#10;use std::path::PathBuf;&#10;&#10;fn load_config(path: &amp;PathBuf) -&gt; Result&lt;toml::Value&gt; {&#10;    let content = std::fs::read_to_string(path)&#10;        .with_context(|| format!(&quot;读取配置文件 &#39;{}&#39; 失败&quot;, path.display()))?;&#10;&#10;    let config: toml::Value = toml::from_str(&amp;content)&#10;        .with_context(|| format!(&quot;解析配置文件 &#39;{}&#39; 失败&quot;, path.display()))?;&#10;&#10;    if config.get(&quot;project&quot;).is_none() {&#10;        bail!(&quot;配置文件缺少 [project] 段落&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    Ok(config)&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let path = PathBuf::from(&quot;config.toml&quot;);&#10;    let config = load_config(&amp;path)?;&#10;    println!(&quot;项目: {}&quot;, config[&quot;project&quot;]);&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use anyhow::{Context, Result, bail};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::path::PathBuf;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn load_config(path: &#x26;PathBuf) -> Result&#x3C;toml::Value> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let content = std::fs::read_to_string(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_context(|| format!(\"读取配置文件 '{}' 失败\", path.display()))?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let config: toml::Value = toml::from_str(&#x26;content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_context(|| format!(\"解析配置文件 '{}' 失败\", path.display()))?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if config.get(\"project\").is_none() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bail!(\"配置文件缺少 [project] 段落\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let path = PathBuf::from(\"config.toml\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let config = load_config(&#x26;path)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"项目: {}\", config[\"project\"]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>anyhow</th>\n<th>thiserror</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>应用程序</td>\n<td>库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误类型</td>\n<td>动态 <code>anyhow::Error</code></td>\n<td>自定义枚举</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文附加</td>\n<td><code>.context()</code> / <code>.with_context()</code></td>\n<td><code>#[from]</code> 自动转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误链</td>\n<td>自动保留完整错误链</td>\n<td>通过 <code>#[source]</code> 定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配分支</td>\n<td><code>downcast_ref</code> 动态检查</td>\n<td>编译期 match</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use thiserror::Error;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Error, Debug)]&#10;enum ToolError {&#10;    #[error(&quot;配置文件 &#39;{path}&#39; 不存在&quot;)]&#10;    ConfigNotFound { path: String },&#10;&#10;    #[error(&quot;端口 {port} 已被占用&quot;)]&#10;    PortInUse { port: u16 },&#10;&#10;    #[error(&quot;IO 错误&quot;)]&#10;    Io(#[from] std::io::Error),&#10;&#10;    #[error(&quot;解析错误: {0}&quot;)]&#10;    Parse(#[from] toml::de::Error),&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use thiserror::Error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Error, Debug)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum ToolError {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[error(\"配置文件 '{path}' 不存在\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ConfigNotFound { path: String },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[error(\"端口 {port} 已被占用\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PortInUse { port: u16 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[error(\"IO 错误\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Io(#[from] std::io::Error),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[error(\"解析错误: {0}\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Parse(#[from] toml::de::Error),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"panic-与-graceful-错误\">Panic 与 Graceful 错误</h2><p>在 Rust 中，<strong>panic</strong> 和 <strong>graceful error</strong> 代表两种截然不同的错误处理策略。CLI 工具应几乎总是选择后者。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>panic</td>\n<td>立即终止，打印堆栈</td>\n<td>编程错误（bug），不可恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Result + ?</td>\n<td>向上传播，由调用者决定</td>\n<td>可预见的运行时错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>process::exit</td>\n<td>立即退出，指定退出码</td>\n<td>最终错误处理点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use anyhow::{Context, Result};&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    if let Err(e) = run() {&#10;        eprintln!(&quot;错误: {:#}&quot;, e);&#10;        std::process::exit(1);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn run() -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let path = find_config()?;&#10;    let config = load_config(&amp;path)?;&#10;    execute(&amp;config)?;&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn find_config() -&gt; Result&lt;std::path::PathBuf&gt; {&#10;    let candidates = [&quot;./config.toml&quot;, &quot;~/.config/mytool/config.toml&quot;];&#10;    for c in &amp;candidates {&#10;        let p = std::path::PathBuf::from(c);&#10;        if p.exists() {&#10;            return Ok(p);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    anyhow::bail!(&quot;未找到配置文件，已搜索: {:?}&quot;, candidates);&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn load_config(path: &amp;std::path::Path) -&gt; Result&lt;String&gt; {&#10;    std::fs::read_to_string(path)&#10;        .with_context(|| format!(&quot;读取 &#39;{}&#39; 失败&quot;, path.display()))&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn execute(config: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    println!(&quot;执行配置: {} 字节&quot;, config.len());&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use anyhow::{Context, Result};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if let Err(e) = run() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(\"错误: {:#}\", e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        std::process::exit(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn run() -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let path = find_config()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let config = load_config(&#x26;path)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    execute(&#x26;config)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn find_config() -> Result&#x3C;std::path::PathBuf> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let candidates = [\"./config.toml\", \"~/.config/mytool/config.toml\"];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for c in &#x26;candidates {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let p = std::path::PathBuf::from(c);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if p.exists() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return Ok(p);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    anyhow::bail!(\"未找到配置文件，已搜索: {:?}\", candidates);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn load_config(path: &#x26;std::path::Path) -> Result&#x3C;String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    std::fs::read_to_string(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_context(|| format!(\"读取 '{}' 失败\", path.display()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn execute(config: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"执行配置: {} 字节\", config.len());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 <code>main</code> 函数中捕获所有错误并格式化输出，永远不要让 panic 信息直接展示给终端用户。设置 <code>panic = &quot;abort&quot;</code> 可以在发生 panic 时直接终止而不展示回溯。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误输出的层次\">错误输出的层次</h2><p>成熟的 CLI 工具提供分层的错误输出，用户可以按需获取不同详细程度的信息。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use anyhow::{Context, Result};&#10;&#10;fn run(verbose: bool) -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let result = std::fs::read_to_string(&quot;data.json&quot;)&#10;        .context(&quot;无法加载数据文件&quot;);&#10;&#10;    match result {&#10;        Ok(data) =&gt; {&#10;            println!(&quot;加载了 {} 字节数据&quot;, data.len());&#10;            Ok(())&#10;        }&#10;        Err(e) =&gt; {&#10;            if verbose {&#10;                eprintln!(&quot;详细错误链:&quot;);&#10;                for (i, cause) in e.chain().enumerate() {&#10;                    eprintln!(&quot;  {}: {}&quot;, i, cause);&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;            Err(e)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let verbose = std::env::args().any(|a| a == &quot;-v&quot; || a == &quot;--verbose&quot;);&#10;    if let Err(e) = run(verbose) {&#10;        if !verbose {&#10;            eprintln!(&quot;错误: {}&quot;, e);&#10;            eprintln!(&quot;提示: 使用 -v 查看详细错误信息&quot;);&#10;        }&#10;        std::process::exit(1);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use anyhow::{Context, Result};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn run(verbose: bool) -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = std::fs::read_to_string(\"data.json\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .context(\"无法加载数据文件\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match result {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(data) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"加载了 {} 字节数据\", data.len());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if verbose {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                eprintln!(\"详细错误链:\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                for (i, cause) in e.chain().enumerate() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    eprintln!(\"  {}: {}\", i, cause);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Err(e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let verbose = std::env::args().any(|a| a == \"-v\" || a == \"--verbose\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if let Err(e) = run(verbose) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if !verbose {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            eprintln!(\"错误: {}\", e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            eprintln!(\"提示: 使用 -v 查看详细错误信息\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        std::process::exit(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((错误处理))&#10;    用户友好&#10;      说明发生了什么&#10;      解释为什么&#10;      提示如何修复&#10;    退出码&#10;      0 成功&#10;      1 一般错误&#10;      2 用法错误&#10;      自定义码&#10;    Rust 工具&#10;      anyhow 应用级&#10;      thiserror 库级&#10;      context 错误链&#10;    策略选择&#10;      panic 用于 bug&#10;      Result 用于运行时&#10;      graceful 降级\">mindmap\n  root((错误处理))\n    用户友好\n      说明发生了什么\n      解释为什么\n      提示如何修复\n    退出码\n      0 成功\n      1 一般错误\n      2 用法错误\n      自定义码\n    Rust 工具\n      anyhow 应用级\n      thiserror 库级\n      context 错误链\n    策略选择\n      panic 用于 bug\n      Result 用于运行时\n      graceful 降级</pre><ul>\n<li>用户友好的错误消息应包含发生了什么、为什么发生、如何修复三个要素</li>\n<li>退出码是脚本和自动化流程判断 CLI 工具执行结果的标准机制</li>\n<li>anyhow 适合应用程序的快速错误包装，thiserror 适合库的精确错误定义</li>\n<li>CLI 工具应避免 panic，始终通过 Result 传播错误并在 main 中统一处理</li>\n<li>支持 <code>--verbose</code> 分层错误输出，让用户按需获取详细信息</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"错误处理","id":"错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理的两面","id":"错误处理的两面"},{"level":2,"text":"用户友好的错误消息","id":"用户友好的错误消息"},{"level":2,"text":"退出码约定","id":"退出码约定"},{"level":2,"text":"anyhow 与 thiserror","id":"anyhow-与-thiserror"},{"level":2,"text":"Panic 与 Graceful 错误","id":"panic-与-graceful-错误"},{"level":2,"text":"错误输出的层次","id":"错误输出的层次"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"IO 与流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations/io-and-streams"},"next":{"title":"交互式提示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/interactive-prompts"}}